  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Documentary Heritage Emergency Intervention for TeleLiban Archives</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO will undertake emergency interventions to safeguard the historic and documentary heritage of TeleLiban archives. This will include a rapid assessment, preserving and protecting and safeguarding the U-matic tapes, while carrying out a detailed inventory. Those interventions will support the preparatory ground for a full-fledged nomination to UNESCO Memory of the World international registry.</narrative>
  </description>
